---
source: promql-engine/tests/plan/functions.rs
expression: sort(http_requests_total)
---
Sort: isnan(get_field(array_element(samples, Int64(-1)), Utf8("value"))) ASC NULLS LAST, array_element(samples, Int64(-1)).value ASC NULLS LAST
  Projection: labels, samples, block_start, block_end
    SeriesEval: vector_selector(samples, 1200000..1200000 step 30s, lookback 5m) per series per block
      TableScan: http_requests_total
